*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0041
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-06-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 456
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0041.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> PRIOR BANKRUPTCY Y/N
    05 PRIOR-BK-FLG       PIC X.
       88 PRIOR-BANKRUPT VALUE 'Y'.
    *> YEARS SINCE BANKRUPTCY DISCHARGE
    05 YRS-SINCE-BK       PIC 9(2).
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 DECISION-CD        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 DECISION-DECLINED VALUE 'D'.
    *> DECISION REASON CODE
    05 DECN-REASON        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM BANKRUPTCY-CHECK
    DISPLAY "DECISION-CD=" DECISION-CD
    DISPLAY "DECN-REASON=" DECN-REASON
    STOP RUN.
BANKRUPTCY-CHECK.
    IF PRIOR-BANKRUPT
        *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE
        IF YRS-SINCE-BK < 7
            SET DECISION-DECLINED TO TRUE
            MOVE 'BK1' TO DECN-REASON
        ELSE
            MOVE 'R' TO DECISION-CD
            MOVE 'BK2' TO DECN-REASON
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO DECN-REASON
    END-IF.
